# OpenDaylight Karaf features installed at container startup (see scripts/install-karaf-features.sh).
# Order matters for dependency satisfaction; one feature name per line (whitespace-separated
# tokens on a line are each installed separately).
#
# Pinned for opendaylight/opendaylight base in platform/odl/Dockerfile. If a feature is missing
# on your ODL release, remove or rename it and rebuild platform-odl:0.1.0.

